  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"DelegatingFilterProxyRegistrationBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>DelegatingFilterProxyRegistrationBean</code></a> instance to be\nregistered with the specified <a href=\"ServletRegistrationBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>ServletRegistrationBean</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"DelegatingFilterProxyRegistrationBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>DelegatingFilterProxyRegistrationBean</code></a>实例，并将其注册到指定的<a href=\"ServletRegistrationBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>ServletRegistrationBean</code></a>s 中。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The bean name of the actual delegate <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a> should be specified using the\n<code>targetBeanName</code> constructor argument. Unlike the <a href=\"FilterRegistrationBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>FilterRegistrationBean</code></a>,\nreferenced filters are not instantiated early. In fact, if the delegate filter bean is\nmarked <code>@Lazy</code> it won't be instantiated at all until the filter is called.",
      "translation": "实际委托的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a>` 的 Bean 名称应使用<code>targetBeanName</code>构造参数指定。与<a href=\"FilterRegistrationBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>FilterRegistrationBean</code></a>不同，引用的过滤器不会提前实例化。事实上，如果委托过滤器 Bean 标记为<code>@Lazy</code>，则直到调用该过滤器时才会对其进行实例化。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Registrations can be associated with <a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#setUrlPatterns(java.util.Collection)\"><code>URL patterns</code></a> and/or\nservlets (either by <a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#setServletNames(java.util.Collection)\"><code>name</code></a> or through a\n<a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#setServletRegistrationBeans(java.util.Collection)\"><code>ServletRegistrationBean</code></a>s). When no URL pattern or\nservlets are specified the filter will be associated to '/*'. The targetBeanName will\nbe used as the filter name if not otherwise specified.",
      "translation": "注册可以关联到<a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#setUrlPatterns(java.util.Collection)\"><code>URL 模式</code></a>和/或 servlet（通过<a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#setServletNames(java.util.Collection)\"><code>名称</code></a>或通过<a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#setServletRegistrationBeans(java.util.Collection)\"><code>ServletRegistrationBean</code></a>s）。当未指定 URL 模式或 servlet 时，过滤器将关联到'/*'。如果未另行指定，则使用 targetBeanName 作为过滤器名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from class: <code><a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#getFilter()\">AbstractFilterRegistrationBean</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从类复制：<code><a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#getFilter()\">AbstractFilterRegistrationBean</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a> to be registered.",
      "translation": "返回要注册的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#getFilter()\">getFilter</a></code> in class <code><a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\">AbstractFilterRegistrationBean</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/filter/DelegatingFilterProxy.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.filter\">DelegatingFilterProxy</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html#getFilter()\">getFilter</a></code> 类中的 <code><a href=\"AbstractFilterRegistrationBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\">AbstractFilterRegistrationBean</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/filter/DelegatingFilterProxy.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.filter\">DelegatingFilterProxy</a>&gt;</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>targetBeanName</code> - name of the target filter bean to look up in the Spring\napplication context (must not be <code>null</code>).",
      "translation": "<code>targetBeanName</code> - 要在 Spring 应用程序上下文中查找的目标过滤器 Bean 的名称（不能为 <code>null</code>）。",
      "count": 2
